OL,3,APolice release one of two fatal fire
OL,4,Asuspects
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 31-year-old man arrested on suspicion
OL,7,Fof murder over a fatal house fire has
OL,8,Fbeen released with no further action
OL,9,Fwhile a second man, aged 23, continues
OL,10,Fto be questioned.
OL,12,FNatalie McDonald, 34, died in the blaze
OL,13,Fin Grangetown, near Middlesbrough, in
OL,14,Fthe early hours of Wednesday, along
OL,15,Fwith her niece Valentina Foster, seven.
OL,17,FCleveland Police said a 48-year-old
OL,18,Fwoman had been left in a critical
OL,19,Fcondition in hospital and another three
OL,20,Fpeople had injuries that were not
OL,21,Flife-threatening.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
